h-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7GDeltaSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7GDeltaSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (canonical function predicate)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}g\\text{-}delta\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7GDeltaSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists U_\\bullet\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(U_\\bullet,\\omega,\\tau)\\land A=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\in U_\\bullet(n))\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}g\\text{-}delta\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7GDeltaSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists U_\\bullet\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(U_\\bullet,\\omega,\\tau)\\land A=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\in U_\\bullet(n))\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC topology definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8